        <mxCell id="upd2026-title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;" value="2026 GÜNCELLEME ÖNERİLERİ" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="280" x="-320" y="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="upd2026-legend-g" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="YEŞİL = Öneri / iyileştirme" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="280" x="-320" y="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="upd2026-legend-r" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="KIRMIZI = Kritik güvenlik notu" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="280" x="-320" y="230" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="upd2026-1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="KRİTİK — INPUT GUARDRAIL: Sadece kullanıcı sorgusu değil, ingest edilen doküman içeriği de taranmalı (indirect prompt injection). Araç: NeMo Guardrails / Llama Guard." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="280" x="-320" y="470" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="upd2026-2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="ÖNERİ — ORKESTRASYON (MVP): 7 ajan yerine tek agentic loop + tool seti ile başla; ölçüm sonrası böl. Router + Planner birleştir. Validation ayrı ajan değil, LangGraph node. Agent state için LangGraph PostgresSaver (checkpointing) → kalıcı state, retry, time-travel." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="280" x="-320" y="700" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="upd2026-3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="ÖNERİ — TOOL LAYER: Tool'ları MCP server olarak tasarla (framework bağımsız, yeniden kullanılabilir — 2026 fiili standardı). Hybrid Search: pgvector + tsvector/pg_search + RRF fusion; ayrı arama motoru gerekmez. Ölçek: pgvectorscale ile ~50M vektöre kadar." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="280" x="-320" y="1210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="upd2026-4" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="KRİTİK — SEMANTIC CACHE: Cache tenant/permission-scoped olmalı. Aksi halde kullanıcının erişim yetkisi olmayan içerik cache üzerinden sızar (RBAC bypass)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="280" x="-320" y="1500" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="upd2026-5" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="ÖNERİ — LLM GATEWAY: Dev = Ollama, Prod = vLLM (3-9x throughput, SLA). LiteLLM ile OpenAI-uyumlu soyutlama → motor değişimi bedava. Embedding: BGE-M3 / Qwen3-Embedding (TR destekli; dense+sparse tek modelde). Reranker: bge-reranker-v2-m3 / Qwen3-Reranker. TR performansı golden set ile ölçülmeli." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="220" width="280" x="-320" y="1770" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="upd2026-obs-box" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;dashed=1;" value="OBSERVABILITY &amp; EVALUATION LAYER — Langfuse (YENİ — FAZ 8'den FAZ 2-3'e çekildi, ADR-004/013)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="690" x="80" y="2520" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="upd2026-obs-txt" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=11;" value="Langfuse v3 (Podman @ 192.168.36.15:3000 — ADR-013) + OpenTelemetry tracing (fire-and-forget: platform kapalıyken pipeline etkilenmez) | RAGAS: faithfulness, context precision/recall (judge=Ollama) | Golden QA seti (Türkçe, ≥100) | Retrieval metrikleri + feedback loop | Not: sistem monitoring (CPU/RAM, Prometheus) ayrı — FAZ 10" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="630" x="110" y="2560" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="upd2026-7" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="ÖNERİ — INGESTION: (1) Layout-aware parsing: Docling / Unstructured — tablo ağırlıklı kurumsal PDF'lerde kritik. (2) Entity/Relation extraction MVP'de OPSİYONEL: GraphRAG'ı ayrı faza al; kalitesiz entity çıkarımı RAG'ı iyileştirmez, bozar. (3) GraphDB: Apache AGE küçük graf/egemenlik için uygun; büyüyünce Neo4j / Memgraph, hafif alternatif LightRAG." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="645" x="880" y="880" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="upd2026-e1" edge="1" parent="1" source="2g9Xfks__8yZxwqVsAjh-50" target="upd2026-obs-box" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
